# Memory Slice (.msl) Specification — Authors

This file is the canonical record of authorship for the Memory Slice
specification. The Git commit history is the authoritative, commit-level
record; this file summarizes it in human-readable form.

## Editor

- Daniel Baier <daniel.baier@fkie.fraunhofer.de>

## Contributors

Contributions are welcome. Open a pull request at
<https://github.com/MemorySlice/memslice-spec/> and your name will be added
to this list, ordered by first contribution.

